{"data":[{"id":1306,"text":"I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"wakaran","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335714,"text":"\u6211\u8ba4\u4e3a\u4f60\u8003\u8651\u4e45\u4e86\u5c31\u4f1a\u4e0d\u4e00\u6837\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1355,"text":"I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"wuiwie","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":1427005,"text":"\u6211\u6216\u8bb8\u4e0d\u5584\u4e8e\u793e\u4ea4,\u4f46\u8fd9\u5e76\u4e0d\u610f\u5473\u6211\u4e0d\u548c\u522b\u4eba\u4ea4\u8c08\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"asosan","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1360,"text":"Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":55,"text":"\u4ee5\u524d\u8b80\u9ad8\u4e2d\u7684\u6642\u5019\ufe50\u6211\u6bcf\u5929\u65e9\u4e0a\u516d\u9ede\u8d77\u5e8a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1377,"text":"I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"brauliobezerra","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":454662,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u60f3\u653e\u5f03\u6211\u7684\u60f3\u6cd5\uff0c\u867d\u7136\u4e00\u4e9b\u60f3\u6cd5\u6709\u70b9\u6781\u7aef\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"peipei","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1382,"text":"If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"secretkingdom","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501353,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u6709\u4eba\u95ee\u8d77\u8fd9\u4e2a\u6545\u4e8b\u7684\u7528\u610f\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\uff0c\u6211\u8fd8\u771f\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1401,"text":"Thanks for having explained to me at last why people take me for an idiot.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"chanchan","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13850024,"text":"\u611f\u8b1d\u60a8\u7d42\u65bc\u7232\u6211\u8aaa\u660e\u4e86\u7232\u751a\u9ebc\u4eba\u5011\u901a\u901a\u628a\u6211\u7576\u50bb\u74dc\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"DaoSeng","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1412,"text":"If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"AlanF_US","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501410,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u6211\u662f\u60f3\u5413\u4f60\uff0c\u6211\u5c31\u4f1a\u544a\u8bc9\u4f60\u6211\u51e0\u5468\u524d\u68a6\u5230\u7684\u4e8b\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1419,"text":"I wouldn't have thought I would someday look up \"Viagra\" in Wikipedia.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Nudl","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334247,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u4f1a\u60f3\u5230\u6709\u4e00\u5929\u6211\u4f1a\u5728\u7ef4\u57fa\u767e\u79d1\u67e5\u627e\u201c\u4f1f\u54e5\u201d\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1444,"text":"It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"brauliobezerra","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":335052,"text":"\u6709\u4e00\u5929\u6211\u53bb\u6cd5\u56fd\u662f\u65e0\u53ef\u907f\u514d\u7684\uff0c\u6211\u53ea\u662f\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u4f55\u65f6\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":3701802,"text":"\u6211\u7e3d\u6709\u4e00\u5929\u662f\u5fc5\u9808\u53bb\u6cd5\u570b\u7684\uff0c\u4f46\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u662f\u4f55\u6642\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"egg0073","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1495,"text":"It's no use pretending to make me believe that I believe things you don't believe!","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"wakaran","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334704,"text":"\u8981\u6211\u76f8\u4fe1\u6211\u4f1a\u76f8\u4fe1\u4f60\u4e0d\u76f8\u4fe1\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\u662f\u6ca1\u7528\u7684\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1496,"text":"It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334703,"text":"\u7ed9\u4f60\u89e3\u91ca\u8fd9\u4e3a\u4ec0\u4e48\u884c\u4e0d\u901a\u8981\u82b1\u5f88\u591a\u65f6\u95f4\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1497,"text":"I'm so dumb... I'm trying to explain things to you that I don't understand myself.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334702,"text":"\u6211\u592a\u611a\u8822\u4e86...\u6211\u7adf\u7136\u8bd5\u7740\u7ed9\u4f60\u89e3\u91ca\u6211\u81ea\u5df1\u90fd\u4e0d\u61c2\u7684\u4e1c\u897f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1500,"text":"There will always be things I will never learn, I don't have eternity before me!","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"bmorsello","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334700,"text":"\u603b\u6709\u4e00\u4e9b\u4e1c\u897f\u6211\u6c38\u8fdc\u4e0d\u80fd\u5b66\u4f1a\uff0c\u6211\u7684\u751f\u547d\u4e0d\u662f\u6c38\u6052\u7684\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1508,"text":"\"What's going on in the cave? I'm curious.\" \"I have no idea.\"","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"CK","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334484,"text":"\u201c\u6d1e\u91cc\u53d1\u751f\u4e86\u4ec0\u4e48\uff1f\u6211\u5f88\u597d\u5947\u3002\u201d\u201c\u6211\u4e00\u70b9\u4e5f\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\u201d","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":779000,"text":"\"\u5c71\u6d1e\u88e1\u767c\u751f\u4e86\u4ec0\u9ebc\u4e8b?\" \u6211\u5f88\u597d\u5947\u3002\"\u6211\u4e0d\u77e5\u9053\u3002\"","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1509,"text":"We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"wuiwie","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334481,"text":"\u6211\u4eec\u5fc5\u987b\u5b66\u4f1a\u50cf\u5144\u5f1f\u4e00\u6837\u5171\u540c\u751f\u6d3b\uff0c\u8981\u4e48\u5c31\u50cf\u50bb\u5b50\u4e00\u6837\u540c\u5f52\u4e8e\u5c3d\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1511,"text":"\"To tell you the truth, I am scared of heights.\" \"You are a coward!\"","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Tesseract42","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334479,"text":"\u201c\u5766\u767d\u8bf4\uff0c\u6211\u6709\u6050\u9ad8\u75c7\u3002\u201d\u201c\u4f60\u662f\u4e2a\u80c6\u5c0f\u9b3c\uff01\u201d","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1524,"text":"It is up to you to decide whether we will go there or not.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334463,"text":"\u8be5\u7531\u4f60\u6765\u51b3\u5b9a\u6211\u4eec\u53bb\u4e0d\u53bb\u90a3\u513f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":406365,"text":"\u6211\u4eec\u53bb\u4e0d\u53bb\u90a3\u513f\u7531\u4f60\u6765\u51b3\u5b9a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1550,"text":"Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334439,"text":"\u9664\u4e86\u90a3\u4e9b\u6211\u4eec\u5c1d\u8bd5\u8fc7\u7684\u653f\u5e9c\u5f62\u6001\uff0c\u6c11\u4e3b\u662f\u6700\u5dee\u7684\u90a3\u79cd\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1551,"text":"When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Dejo","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501426,"text":"\u5f53\u6211\u4eec\u5f00\u59cb\u50cf\u81ea\u5df1\u62a4\u7167\u4e0a\u7684\u7167\u7247\u65f6\uff0c\u6211\u4eec\u8be5\u53bb\u5ea6\u5047\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1583,"text":"Poor is not the one who has too little, but the one who wants too much.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"AlanF_US","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334183,"text":"\u8d2b\u7a77\u7684\u4e0d\u662f\u62e5\u6709\u592a\u5c11\u7684\u4eba\uff0c\u800c\u662f\u60f3\u8981\u592a\u591a\u7684\u4eba\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1586,"text":"This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"CK","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":1778287,"text":"\u8fd9\u5c06\u662f\u6211\u73af\u7ed5\u7f8e\u56fd\u65c5\u884c\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u5f88\u597d\u7684\u7eaa\u5ff5\u54c1\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"sadhen","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1587,"text":"Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"blay_paul","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334179,"text":"\u62b1\u6b49\uff0c\u8bf7\u5141\u8bb8\u6211\u6307\u51fa\u4e0a\u6587\u4e2d\u7684\u4e09\u4e2a\u9519\u8bef\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1589,"text":"It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\".","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"papabear","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334177,"text":"\u548c\u4e00\u4e2a\u53ea\u8bf4\"\u662f\"\u4e0e\"\u5426\"\u7684\u4eba\u7ef4\u6301\u4e00\u6bb5\u5bf9\u8bdd\u662f\u5f88\u96be\u7684\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":343412,"text":"\u8ddf\u4e00\u4e2a\u53ea\u8bf4\u201c\u662f\u201d\u548c\u201c\u4e0d\u662f\u201d\u7684\u4eba\u5f88\u96be\u7ee7\u7eed\u8c08\u8bdd\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1617,"text":"It took me more than two hours to translate a few pages of English.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"CK","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":334142,"text":"\u7ffb\u8bd1\u51e0\u9875\u82f1\u6587\u82b1\u4e86\u62112\u4e2a\u591a\u5c0f\u65f6\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1640,"text":"You opened up my eyes to what it's like when everything is right.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"AlanF_US","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13116268,"text":"\u4f60\u8b93\u6211\u770b\u5230\u4e86\u4e00\u5207\u9806\u5229\u6642\u7684\u6a23\u5b50\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1669,"text":"Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"pyrachi","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":71,"text":"\u751f\u6d3b\u5c31\u662f\u7576\u4f60\u5fd9\u8457\u9032\u884c\u4f60\u7684\u8a08\u5283\u6642\u7e3d\u6709\u5176\u4ed6\u7684\u4e8b\u60c5\u767c\u751f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1685,"text":"My friends always say I'm too calm, but my family always says I'm too annoying.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Dreamk33","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501575,"text":"\u6211\u7684\u670b\u53cb\u4eec\u603b\u662f\u8bf4\u6211\u592a\u5b89\u9759\u4e86\uff0c\u800c\u6211\u7684\u5bb6\u4eba\u603b\u662f\u8bf4\u6211\u592a\u8ba9\u4eba\u70e6\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1693,"text":"Better to be hated for who you are than loved for who you're not.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501584,"text":"\u5b81\u613f\u505a\u81ea\u5df1\u800c\u88ab\u4eba\u8ba8\u538c\uff0c\u4e5f\u4e0d\u8981\u56e0\u4e3a\u865a\u5047\u800c\u88ab\u4eba\u559c\u6b22\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1730,"text":"One hundred and fifty thousand couples are expected to get married in Shanghai in 2006.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501704,"text":"\u9884\u8ba12006\u5e7415\u4e07\u5bf9\u592b\u5987\u5c06\u4f1a\u5728\u4e0a\u6d77\u7d50\u5a5a\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1733,"text":"It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501708,"text":"\u5728\u79d1\u6280\u51c6\u5907\u597d\u4e4b\u524d\u9700\u8981\u4e94\u5230\u5341\u5e74\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1735,"text":"The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"AlanF_US","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":13117874,"text":"\u6cd5\u570b\u653f\u5e9c\u767c\u5e03\u4e86\u4e00\u6b3e\u7dda\u4e0a\u904a\u6232\uff0c\u8b93\u7d0d\u7a05\u4eba\u6311\u6230\u5e73\u8861\u570b\u5bb6\u9810\u7b97\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"LeviHighway","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1740,"text":"When you're trying to prove something, it helps to know it's true.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":772163,"text":"\u7576\u4f60\u8a66\u5716\u53bb\u8b49\u660e\u67d0\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u5148\u77e5\u9053\u5b83\u662f\u771f\u7684\u6703\u6709\u6240\u5e6b\u52a9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1743,"text":"If you don't understand something, it's because you aren't aware of its context.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":501711,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u4e0d\u660e\u767d\u4e00\u4ef6\u4e8b\uff0c\u90a3\u662f\u56e0\u4e3a\u4f60\u6ca1\u6709\u610f\u8bc6\u5230\u5b83\u7684\u80cc\u666f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1744,"text":"The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":459764,"text":"\u6211\u5011\u53ef\u4ee5\u56de\u9867\u904e\u53bb\uff0c\u4f46\u4e0d\u80fd\u6539\u8b8a\u904e\u53bb\uff1b\u6211\u5011\u53ef\u4ee5\u6539\u8b8a\u672a\u4f86\uff0c\u4f46\u4e0d\u80fd\u9810\u77e5\u672a\u4f86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"nickyeow","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1747,"text":"Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":772164,"text":"\u4efb\u4f55\u7c21\u55ae\u5230\u53ef\u4ee5\u88ab\u4e86\u89e3\u7684\u5b87\u5b99\u4fbf\u592a\u904e\u7c21\u55ae\u800c\u7121\u6cd5\u7522\u751f\u53ef\u4ee5\u4e86\u89e3\u5b83\u7684\u5fc3\u9748\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1768,"text":"There's no point saying \"Hi, how are you?\" to me if you have nothing else to say.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":332745,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u6ca1\u6709\u5176\u5b83\u53ef\u8bf4\u7684\uff0c\u90a3\u5bf9\u6211\u8bf4\u201c\u55e8\uff0c\u4f60\u600e\u4e48\u6837\uff1f\u201d\u5c31\u6beb\u65e0\u610f\u4e49\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"popolady","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1769,"text":"In a dictionary like this one there should be at least two sentences with \"fridge\".","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":403624,"text":"\u9019\u6a23\u7684\u5b57\u5178\u6700\u5c11\u4e5f\u61c9\u8a72\u6709\u5169\u53e5\u300c\u51b0\u7bb1\u300d\u7684\u4f8b\u53e5\u5427\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"nickyeow","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1774,"text":"A democrat is a free citizen who yields to the will of the majority.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"pyrachi","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502710,"text":"\u6c11\u4e3b\u4e3b\u4e49\u8005\u662f\u5c48\u670d\u4e8e\u5927\u90e8\u5206\u4eba\u7684\u81ea\u7531\u516c\u6c11\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1793,"text":"Mathematicians are poets, except that they have to prove what their fantasy creates.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":809921,"text":"\u6578\u5b78\u5bb6\u662f\u8a69\u4eba\uff0c\u4e0d\u904e\u4ed6\u5011\u5fc5\u9808\u4e5f\u80fd\u8b49\u660e\u4ed6\u5011\u60f3\u50cf\u529b\u7684\u679c\u5be6\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Martha","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1797,"text":"There are 10 types of people in the world: those who understand binary, and those who don't.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"bmorsello","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502739,"text":"\u4e16\u754c\u4e0a\u670910\u79cd\u4eba\uff1a\u61c2\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u548c\u4e0d\u61c2\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u7684\u4eba\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":1233202,"text":"\u4e16\u754c\u4e0a\u670910\u79cd\u4eba\uff1a\u61c2\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u7684\u4eba\u548c\u4e0d\u61c2\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u7684\u4eba\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"sadhen","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1832,"text":"I can't take it anymore! I haven't slept for three days!","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":402499,"text":"\u6211\u5df2\u7d93\u4e09\u5929\u6c92\u7761\u89ba\u4e86\uff0c\u771f\u662f\u774f\u6b7b\u4e86\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hant","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"nickyeow","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true},{"id":502777,"text":"\u6211\u4e0d\u884c\u4e86\uff01\u6211\u5df2\u7ecf\u4e09\u5929\u6ca1\u7761\u8fc7\u4e86\uff01","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1840,"text":"It's a pity that you can't buy miracles like you would buy potatoes.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"AlanF_US","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502782,"text":"\u53ef\u60dc\u6211\u4eec\u4e0d\u80fd\u50cf\u4e70\u571f\u8c46\u4e00\u6837\u4e70\u5947\u8ff9\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1854,"text":"In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"TRANG","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":389790,"text":"\u7406\u8bba\u4e0a\u8bf4\uff0c\u7406\u8bba\u548c\u5b9e\u8df5\u6ca1\u6709\u533a\u522b\u3002\u4f46\u5b9e\u8df5\u4e0a\u8bf4\uff0c\u662f\u6709\u7684\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1858,"text":"It requires wisdom to understand wisdom: the music is nothing if the audience is deaf.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"bmorsello","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502838,"text":"\u8981\u7528\u667a\u6167\u6765\u7406\u89e3\u667a\u6167\uff1a\u5982\u679c\u542c\u4f17\u662f\u804b\u7684\u8bdd\uff0c\u90a3\u97f3\u4e50\u4ec0\u4e48\u90fd\u4e0d\u662f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1863,"text":"I was planning on going to the beach today, but then it started to rain.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502840,"text":"\u6211\u672c\u6765\u9884\u5907\u4eca\u5929\u53bb\u6d77\u6ee9\u7684\uff0c\u4f46\u63a5\u7740\u5929\u5c31\u5f00\u59cb\u4e0b\u96e8\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1872,"text":"If two men always have the same opinion, one of them is unnecessary.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502846,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u4e24\u4e2a\u4eba\u603b\u662f\u610f\u89c1\u76f8\u540c\uff0c\u90a3\u4e48\u4ed6\u4eec\u5176\u4e2d\u4e00\u4e2a\u5c31\u6ca1\u5fc5\u8981\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1884,"text":"It is easier to hit on people on the Internet than in the street.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Swift","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502852,"text":"\u5728\u7f51\u4e0a\u52fe\u4eba\u6bd4\u5728\u8857\u4e0a\u5bb9\u6613\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1889,"text":"How many times a day do you look at yourself in the mirror?","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"Zifre","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502856,"text":"\u4f60\u4e00\u5929\u7167\u51e0\u6b21\u955c\u5b50\uff1f","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1894,"text":"If you don't have anything to do, look at the ceiling of your room.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"orcrist","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502859,"text":"\u5982\u679c\u4f60\u6ca1\u4e8b\u505a\uff0c\u90a3\u5c31\u770b\u4f60\u623f\u95f4\u7684\u5929\u82b1\u677f\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]},{"id":1901,"text":"It's presumptuous for humans to assume that our task is to do what only God can do.","lang":"eng","script":null,"license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"pyrachi","is_unapproved":false,"translations":[{"id":502873,"text":"\u4eba\u7c7b\u5047\u8bbe\u6211\u4eec\u7684\u4efb\u52a1\u662f\u5b8c\u6210\u53ea\u6709\u4e0a\u5e1d\u80fd\u505a\u7684\u4e8b\uff0c\u8fd9\u592a\u81ea\u4ee5\u4e3a\u662f\u4e86\u3002","lang":"cmn","script":"Hans","license":"CC BY 2.0 FR","owner":"fucongcong","is_unapproved":false,"is_direct":true}]}],"paging":{"total":3365,"has_next":true,"next":"https:\/\/api.tatoeba.org\/v1\/sentences?lang=eng&trans%3Alang=cmn&trans%3Ais_direct=yes&is_unapproved=no&is_orphan=no&trans%3Ais_unapproved=no&trans%3Ais_orphan=no&showtrans=matching&limit=60&sort=-created&word_count=13-18&after=0%2C1901"}}
